egiada.","en":"Villa Violeta is a luxury villa for sale in Las Lomas de Magna Marbella on the Golden Mile. The property offers 5 bedrooms and 5 bathrooms across three levels. It has been fully refurbished and decorated to a high standard by Pedro Peña. Multiple terraces enjoy impressive views of the Mediterranean Sea and surrounding mountains.\n\nThe villa combines elegant interiors with excellent privacy and generous outdoor spaces. It also offers 300 m² of private garden space. Each terrace offers beautiful views while the private lift provides easy access between all three floors. Residents also have access to a communal swimming pool within the exclusive gated development.\n\nLas Lomas de Magna Marbella offers 24-hour security in one of the Golden Mile’s most sought-after residential areas. International schools and ‌Marbella’s ‌key ‌amenities ‌are ‌within ‌easy reach. ‌Villa Violeta ‌is an excellent choice for ‌buyers ‌seeking ‌a ‌luxury ‌home with sea views ‌and ‌security ‌in ‌a ‌prime ‌Marbella ‌location."},"features":{"es":["Cerca de Golf","Cerca de Puerto","Cerca de Tiendas","Cerca del Mar","Cerca de Ciudad","Cerca de Colegios","Sureste","Excelente","Reformado Recientemente","Comunitaria","Aire Acondicionado","Calefacción Central.","Chimenea","Mar","Montaña","Panorámicas","Jardín","Terraza Cubierta","Ascensor","Armarios Empotrados","Cerca de Transporte","Terraza Privada","Solario","Trastero","Lavadero","Sótano","Amueblada","Cocina Comedor","Privado","Recinto Cerrado","Seguridad 24 Horas","Más de uno","Privado","Lujo"],"en":["Close To Golf","Close To Port","Close To Shops","Close To Sea","Close To Town","Close To Schools","South East","Excellent","Recently Renovated","Communal","Air Conditioning","Central Heating","Fireplace","Sea","Mountain","Panoramic","Garden","Covered Terrace","Lift","Fitted Wardrobes","Near Transport","Private Terrace","Solarium","Storage Room","Utility Room","Basement","Fully Furnished","Kitchen-Lounge","Private","Gated Complex","24 Ho